<bold>Primary Mechanism of Action</bold>
</td>
                <td style="width: 2700.17px; height: 60.6667px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Primary Lipid Effects</bold>
</td>
                <td style="width: 840.833px; height: 60.6667px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Key Indications</bold>
</td>
