                <td style="width: 1434px; height: 75px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">siRNA targeting PCSK9 mRNA (prevents PCSK9 production)</td>
                <td style="width: 2700.17px; height: 75px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02193; LDL-C (significant) and &#x02193; Lp(a)</td>
                <td style="width: 840.833px; height: 75px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Primary hyperlipidemia and HeFH (adjunct to diet/statins)</td>
                <td style="width: 697px; height: 75px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Injectable (subcutaneous) and favorable dosing (eg, twice yearly)</td>
              </tr>
